<title>POLAND: DROSED FEB NET SWINGS TO PROFIT.</title>
<headline>DROSED FEB NET SWINGS TO PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.46 vs   0.02 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.89 vs   0.06</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.49 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Sales		   14.12 vs   8.31</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.97 vs  0.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.77 vs  0.63</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.28 vs  0.79</p>
<p> Sales		   28.70 vs 14.12</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry processor is Siedlecki</p>
<p>Zaklady Drobiarskie Drosed SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
